  "text": "This solution, Hazards Insurance Partnership (HIP) addresses natural catastrophe through public private partnerships in Australia between National Emergency Management Agency (NEMA), Treasury, Australian Bureau of Statistics (ABS), Australian Climate Service, Insurance Council of Australia (ICA), Hollard, Munich Re, and Swiss Re. The program was implemented in 2022 and focuses on collaboration, raising awareness, and regulation.",
